# Hi there, fellow human! This file provides a quick introduction to the people behind Hola.org.

# About Us:
Hola believes in Online Democracy and is driven by innovation and a passion for Internet Freedom. We are committed to creating a borderless internet where worldwide online access is a reality for all.

Think of Hola as your ultimate travel pass to explore the internet without borders, giving you easy access to content from all over the world. We're on a mission to make the web open and connected for everyone!

# Contact:
We love hearing from users! For any questions or feedback, reach out at:
- Support: support@hola.org
- General inquiries: info@hola.org
- Press: press@hola.org

# Team:
Hola is built by a diverse team of engineers, designers, and privacy enthusiasts from around the globe. We work hard to give you the best experience possible.

#DNA: Hola's DNA focuses on creating a faster, more open internet through consistency, learning, and teaching. By continuously improving and removing outdated features, Hola fosters innovation, efficiency, and a global impact, ensuring products that adapt quickly and serve users effectively.

# Thanks for visiting!
We hope you're enjoying our service. Stay secure and happy browsing!

